@startuml 06-final-architecture
title MAESTRO — Final Future-Proof Architecture

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Helvetica"
skinparam rectangle {
    BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    BorderColor #2E3B4E
    FontStyle bold
}

rectangle "Product Layer"     as Product   #E3F2FD
rectangle "Process Layer"     as Process   #E1F5FE
rectangle "Capability Layer"  as Cap       #FFF9C4
rectangle "Skill Layer"       as Skill     #FFE0B2

rectangle "ROS"        as ROS       #F8BBD0
rectangle "IEC 61131"  as PLC       #F8BBD0
rectangle "IEC 61499"  as FBN       #F8BBD0

rectangle "OPC UA Layer"      as OPCUA    #D1C4E9
rectangle "Resource Layer"    as Resource #C5E1A5
rectangle "Motion Layer"      as Motion   #B3E5FC
rectangle "Physical Factory"  as Factory  #BDBDBD

Product   -down-> Process
Process   -down-> Cap
Cap       -down-> Skill

Skill -down-> ROS
Skill -down-> PLC
Skill -down-> FBN

ROS  -down-> OPCUA
PLC  -down-> OPCUA
FBN  -down-> OPCUA

OPCUA    -down-> Resource
Resource -down-> Motion
Motion   -down-> Factory

@enduml
